  unitName: Crash Belt (EU)
  unitId: 740153
  unitNumber: 7095
  description: "Crash Belt is considered a nut job even among Coal Cauldron\u2019s
    gang. But according to them, he recently outdid himself. When asked what he was
    doing in the middle of the city with his old Techs and pieces of sails, he jumped
    from the highest towers, yelling, \u201CI AM GOING TO GATHER THE POWER OF THE
    SKY HIIIAAAARRR!!!!\u201D According to the latest news, he\u2019s dead."
